<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SUPERSPORT SERIES SCORES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SUPERSPORT SERIES SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Close of play scores on the</p>
<p>first day of four-day Supersport Series cricket matches on</p>
<p>Friday:</p>
<p>In East London: Border 312-6 (Peter Kirsten 127 not out) v</p>
<p>Griqualand West.</p>
<p>In Paarl: Free State 254 (Kosie Venter 59; Henry Williams</p>
<p>4-58). Boland 28-0.</p>
<p>In Johannesburg: Natal 294-7 (Jonty Rhodes 94 not out; Clive</p>
<p>Eksteen 4-66) v Transvaal.</p>
<p>In Port Elizabeth: Eastern Province 330-5 (Louis Koen 87,</p>
<p>Kepler Wessels 58) v Northern Transvaal.</p>
</text>
